  "intended_behavior": "Remove Entity.name from v1 construction, reads, and decoded observations in all three runtimes. Preserve entity_id, the three-service order, four round-trip cases, and negative validation assertions. Reserve field number 2 and name name. Preserve entity_id when decoding a legacy payload containing field 2. v2 behavior is unchanged. Generated bindings are regenerated by the host using buf generate; never edit generated files.",
  "change": {
    "id": "entity-name-removal-001",
    "category": "field_removed",
    "old_schema": "syntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage simulation.v1;\n\nmessage Entity {\n  string entity_id = 1;\n  string name = 2;\n}\n",
    "new_schema": "syntax = \"proto3\";\n\npackage simulation.v1;\n\nmessage Entity {\n  string entity_id = 1;\n  reserved 2;\n  reserved \"name\";\n}\n",
    "schema_path": "proto/v1/entity.proto"
  },
